<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<scheme version="2.0" title="Ch.2 reference values (acetic acid NIR)" description="1 mm spectra of water + 3 vinegars with four reference values. Formula computes the titration acidity (V x 1.07875 x 0.24) and its ratio to Atago 11/03; Select Columns picks 2258.067 nm and the target; Test and Score (Test on train data) gives the R2 of each reference. Data: ../../data/spectra_1mm_refs_orange.csv">
